      {
        "body": "Local receiver fixture hardened: exhausted processing now raises DeliveryFailed for upstream retry instead of dropping deliveries. Added raw-body HMAC-SHA256 authentication accepting all configured active rotation keys, payload limits, mutation-isolated retries and sanitized logs. Seven unittest checks pass. Production billing still requires an HTTP adapter matching the sender protocol, durable delivery handling and transactional processor idempotency; these integrations are absent from this workspace.",
